def infopage(slug,title,lead,body):
    v=f"""<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>x</title><meta name="description" content="x"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../style.css"></head><body>
<a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
<header class="site"><nav class="bar" aria-label="Main"><a href="../index.html" >{BRAND}<span class="vh">, home</span></a><ul><li><a href="../index.html#tools">All tools</a></li><li><a href="../about/">About</a></li><li><a href="../contact/">Contact</a></li></ul></nav>
<div class="hero"><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="crumbs"><ol><li><a href="../index.html">Home</a></li><li aria-current="page">{title}</li></ol></nav><h1>{title}</h1><p>{lead}</p></div></header>
<div class="layout"><main id="main"><section class="card prose" aria-label="{title}">{body}</section></main><!--RAIL--></div>
{FOOTER.replace('HREFBASE','../')}<script src="../helper.js" data-base="../" defer></script></body></html>"""
    os.makedirs(slug,exist_ok=True);open(slug+'/index.html','w').write(v)
infopage('about','About GWB','GWB: Greater World Business is your one-stop shop for free small business tools.',f"""<h2>What we do</h2><p>GWB builds simple, single-purpose tools that help freelancers, small businesses and creators get everyday jobs done: making invoices, merging PDFs, compressing images, trimming ringtones, calculating margins and more. There are currently {tcount()} tools, and we add new ones based on what people ask for.</p>
<h2>How our tools work</h2><p>Every tool runs entirely in your web browser. Your files, text and numbers are processed on your own device and are never uploaded to us. That makes the tools fast, private and free to run, which is why we can offer them without accounts or limits.</p>
<h2>How GWB is funded</h2><p>The tools are free forever. We are supported by optional tips and supporter memberships, and we may show a small number of clearly labeled advertisements. We never use pop-ups, interstitials or ads that cover content.</p>
<h2>Get in touch</h2><p>Have an idea for a tool, found a bug, or want to share feedback? Visit our <a href="../contact/">contact page</a> or email <a href="mailto:gwm.tech@greaterworldmedia.tech">gwm.tech@greaterworldmedia.tech</a>.</p>""")
infopage('contact','Contact','Questions, feedback, tool ideas or bug reports: we read every message.',"""<h2>Email us</h2><p>The best way to reach GWB is by email: <a href="mailto:gwm.tech@greaterworldmedia.tech">gwm.tech@greaterworldmedia.tech</a>. We aim to reply within a few business days.</p>
<h2>What to include</h2><ul><li><strong>Bug reports:</strong> the tool name, your browser and device, and what happened.</li><li><strong>Tool ideas:</strong> what you are trying to get done and how you do it today.</li><li><strong>Reviews:</strong> tell us which tool you used and how it helped. With your permission, we may publish it on our home page.</li><li><strong>Privacy requests:</strong> see our <a href="../privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</li></ul>
<p><a class="btn" href="mailto:gwm.tech@greaterworldmedia.tech?subject=GWB%20feedback">Email GWB</a></p>""")
infopage('privacy','Privacy Policy','How GWB handles information, cookies, analytics and advertising.',"""<p><em>Last updated: October 16, 2026</em></p><h2>Affiliate links</h2><p>Tool pages include a small “Recommended tools” section with links to third-party products and services (for example Amazon, QuickBooks, FreshBooks, Gusto, Canva and Namecheap). Some of these links may be affiliate links, which means GWB may earn a commission if you buy through them, at no extra cost to you. These links are marked as sponsored. Recommendations are chosen for relevance to each tool, and affiliate relationships never change how our free tools work. When you follow a link, the other site’s own privacy policy and terms apply.</p>
<h2>Summary</h2><p>GWB's tools run in your browser. Files, text and numbers you use in a tool are processed on your device and are not uploaded to or stored by GWB. This policy explains the limited information that may be collected when you visit the site.</p>
<h2>Information processed by the tools</h2><p>Content you open or type into a tool stays on your device. Some tools remember small preferences in your browser's local or session storage (for example, whether you have seen the “Find a tool” helper and your last helper search). You can clear this at any time in your browser settings.</p>
<h2>Hosting and server logs</h2><p>The site is hosted on GitHub Pages. GitHub may collect technical information such as IP addresses in server logs for security and operations. See <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">GitHub's privacy statement</a>.</p>
<h2>Analytics</h2><p>We use <a href="https://www.goatcounter.com/">GoatCounter</a>, a privacy-friendly, cookieless analytics service, to count page views and learn which tools are useful. It does not use cookies or track you across sites, and it collects only aggregated, non-identifying information such as the page visited, referrer, browser type, screen size and country. Per-page view totals are public, and our home page uses them to show the most popular tools. See <a href="https://www.goatcounter.com/help/privacy">GoatCounter's privacy policy</a>.</p><p>To show a “Recently used” list on the home page, your browser remembers which tools you opened in its local storage. This list never leaves your device, and you can clear it in your browser settings.</p>
<h2>Advertising and cookies</h2><p>We may display ads from third-party vendors, including Google. Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to this website or other websites. Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to you based on your visit to this site and/or other sites on the Internet.</p>
<p>You may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://adssettings.google.com">Google Ads Settings</a> (My Ad Center). You can also opt out of some third-party vendors' use of cookies for personalized advertising at <a href="https://optout.aboutads.info/">www.aboutads.info/choices</a>. Learn more about <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites">how Google uses information from sites that use its services</a>.</p>
<p>Visitors in the European Economic Area, the United Kingdom and Switzerland will be asked for consent through a Google-certified consent management platform before personalized ads or related cookies are used.</p>
<h2>Payments</h2><p>Tips and supporter memberships are processed by Stripe. GWB does not receive or store your card details. See <a href="https://stripe.com/privacy">Stripe's privacy policy</a>.</p>
<h2>Children</h2><p>The site is not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>
<h2>Your choices and contact</h2><p>You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings. For any privacy question or request, email <a href="mailto:gwm.tech@greaterworldmedia.tech">gwm.tech@greaterworldmedia.tech</a>.</p>""")
infopage('terms','Terms of Use','The rules for using GWB tools and this website.',"""<p><em>Last updated: October 16, 2026</em></p><h2>Affiliate links</h2><p>Tool pages include a small “Recommended tools” section with links to third-party products and services (for example Amazon, QuickBooks, FreshBooks, Gusto, Canva and Namecheap). Some of these links may be affiliate links, which means GWB may earn a commission if you buy through them, at no extra cost to you. These links are marked as sponsored. Recommendations are chosen for relevance to each tool, and affiliate relationships never change how our free tools work. When you follow a link, the other site’s own privacy policy and terms apply.</p>
<h2>Using the tools</h2><p>GWB tools are provided free of charge for personal and commercial use. You agree to use them lawfully and only with files and content you own or have the rights to use. The audio and video tools must not be used to infringe copyright.</p>
<h2>No warranty</h2><p>The tools and content are provided “as is”, without warranties of any kind. Results from calculators, generators and templates (including policy templates) are for general information and are not legal, financial or professional advice. Always review outputs before relying on them.</p>
<h2>Limitation of liability</h2><p>To the extent permitted by law, GWB is not liable for any indirect, incidental or consequential damages, or for loss of data, arising from your use of the site or tools. Because files are processed on your device, keep your own backups.</p>
<h2>Tips and memberships</h2><p>Tips and supporter memberships are voluntary contributions processed by Stripe. Memberships can be cancelled at any time through the link in your Stripe receipt or by emailing us. Contributions do not unlock extra features.</p>
<h2>Third-party links and ads</h2><p>The site may contain links to third-party sites and clearly labeled advertisements. We are not responsible for third-party content or practices.</p>
<h2>Changes and contact</h2><p>We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the site means you accept the updated terms. Questions: <a href="mailto:gwm.tech@greaterworldmedia.tech">gwm.tech@greaterworldmedia.tech</a>.</p>""")

